      "Changelog": "### Fish\n- Tour panel now shows **Now**, **Next Up**, and **Leave At**.\n- Tours reserve time for the next fish and only catch what fits before departure.\n- **Tasks → GC** catches and turns in the daily Grand Company Provisioning mission.\n- Tours replenish low-stock bait during bait runs.\n- Bait quantities below 50 are restocked before departure.\n- Single fish now respect the wait limit, including Intuition fish.\n- Surface Slap is removed when Intuition expires and the target fish is needed again.\n- Improved GP management during Intuition preparation and short Intuition windows.\n- Added count boxes to Fish and Hunter rows, tracking only new catches.\n\n### Bait\n- Added new vendors:\n  - Synnove\n  - Mare Lamentorum Junkmonger\n  - Denys (requires the **Mislaid Plans** quest)\n\n### Ocean\n- Catches made during the final 30 seconds of a stop now count.\n\n### Ocean Achievements (Mantas, Shrimp, Mantis)\n- Identical Cast is preserved for completing achievement goals.\n- **Mantas:** Third stops can now trigger Spectral Currents.\n- **Shrimp:** Prioritizes shrimp instead of chasing the Sirensong Spectral Current.\n- Stops without target fish now build Angler's Art for the next stop.",
